{"3602700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sketchbook", "steam_appid": 3602700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes I try to remember the old house. My sister’s face. How we used to play, how I nursed her when she was sick…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But my mind always drags me back — to that day. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The day the fire took everything.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My childhood burned with that house. The memories… twisted. Fragments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After we moved, my parents never spoke of it. As if silence could bury the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But I know. It was no accident.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If your machine can really send me back… I’ll see it again. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The flames. The screams.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What really happened.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help me, Professor.</i>Step into the protagonist's shoes and journey through the haunting corridors of your childhood memories. Uncover the truth buried beneath the veil of forgotten past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay Experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies using magical weapon;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that require unconventional thinking;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an enchanted forest full of dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of childhood—with its fears, dreams, and mysteries;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the secrets of a morally ambiguous story through the lens of memories.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics – gravity manipulation, time slowdown, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant world – detailed environments with a touch of nostalgic charm;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic story – a deep narrative with complex characters and unexpected twists;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre-blending – a mix of horror, adventure, and fast-paced shooter elements in one piece;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating soundtrack – music that enhances the atmosphere and emotions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awareness-based combat – victory goes to those who spot the threat before it materializes.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sometimes I try to remember the old house. My sister’s face. How we used to play, how I nursed her when she was sick…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But my mind always drags me back — to that day. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The day the fire took everything.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My childhood burned with that house. The memories… twisted. Fragments.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After we moved, my parents never spoke of it. As if silence could bury the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But I know. It was no accident.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If your machine can really send me back… I’ll see it again. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The flames. The screams.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What really happened.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help me, Professor.</i>Step into the protagonist's shoes and journey through the haunting corridors of your childhood memories. Uncover the truth buried beneath the veil of forgotten past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay Experience:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies using magical weapon;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that require unconventional thinking;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an enchanted forest full of dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa